== Effects ==
* Grants one full Red [[Heart container]].
* {{Dlc|r}} Heals 1 additional {{e|Red Heart}}.

== Notes ==
* This item has a 12.6% chance to spawn from paying out a {{m|Beggar}} in addition to being in the [[Beggar (Item Pool)|Beggar item pool]]. Multiple copies can be obtained through this method.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Binge Eater}}: When Isaac picks up Dinner it now grants: a permanent +0.5 [[Tears]] and +0.2 [[Shot Speed]], a temporary +3.6 [[Damage]] (which diminishes to 0 in 30 seconds), heals 1 additional red heart, and takes a permanent -0.03 [[Speed]] reduction.

